WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:10.680
Series Firewall Total Defense. Season 1 episode 1.
In the vast expanse of the digital universe there exists an unseen shield, a protector

00:10.680 --> 00:17.080
of our precious data, a mystery wrapped in binary code, working tirelessly in the shadows.

00:17.080 --> 00:23.080
We live, work and play in this digital playground, often oblivious to the constant threats lurking

00:23.080 --> 00:24.720
in the dark corners.

00:24.720 --> 00:30.040
Yet we remain safe, our digital lives untouched by these lurking dangers.

00:30.040 --> 00:35.160
How you ask, this silent guardian, this unseen protector, is known as a firewall.

00:35.160 --> 00:40.040
A firewall, not of bricks and mortar but of code and algorithms, stands as our first line

00:40.040 --> 00:42.320
of defense against cyber threats.

00:42.320 --> 00:46.240
Now imagine a bustling city, alive with energy.

00:46.240 --> 00:51.400
This city represents your computer and the people are the data that move in and out.

00:51.400 --> 00:56.120
A firewall is like the city's gatekeeper, scrutinizing every individual, deciding who

00:56.120 --> 00:58.320
can enter and who must leave.

00:58.320 --> 01:03.640
It's a vigilante, tirelessly working, deciding which data packets are friendly citizens and

01:03.640 --> 01:07.400
which ones are intruders based on predetermined security rules.

01:07.400 --> 01:12.000
This digital guardian is designed to monitor and control all incoming and outgoing network

01:12.000 --> 01:13.000
traffic.

01:13.000 --> 01:18.600
It's like a filter, allowing only the data that meets its set criteria to pass through

01:18.600 --> 01:22.240
while blocking anything suspicious or potentially harmful.

01:22.240 --> 01:26.520
In this high-tech era, the firewall's role is paramount.

01:26.520 --> 01:32.780
It is our shield, our defender, our guardian against the ever-looming cyber threats.

01:32.780 --> 01:38.520
Just as a physical wall keeps out unwanted intruders, a firewall keeps out unwanted data.

01:38.520 --> 01:44.520
In an age where data is the new oil, the importance of a firewall cannot be overstressed.

01:44.600 --> 01:49.480
A firewall is like a digital gatekeeper, diligently protecting both personal and professional

01:49.480 --> 01:51.960
data from unauthorized access.

01:51.960 --> 01:56.720
A firewall is like a digital gatekeeper, diligently protecting both personal and professional

01:56.720 --> 01:59.240
data from unauthorized access.

01:59.240 --> 02:04.000
It's the barrier that keeps the virtual wolves at bay, securing our private information from

02:04.000 --> 02:06.800
prying eyes and potential threats.

02:06.800 --> 02:11.400
Without it, our digital lives could be left vulnerable to all sorts of cyber attacks.

02:11.880 --> 02:13.640
Remember, a firewall is not just a tool.

02:13.640 --> 02:16.600
It's our digital knight protecting our data kingdom.

02:16.600 --> 02:22.080
In our brief journey today, we've uncovered the mysteries of the digital protector, the firewall.

02:22.080 --> 02:27.640
This silent guardian stands watch, shielding our delicate digital ecosystems from the relentless

02:27.640 --> 02:29.800
onslaught of cyber threats.

02:29.800 --> 02:34.200
It's not just a tool, but a necessity in our increasingly connected world.

02:34.200 --> 02:39.700
The firewall's role as our first barrier against cyber attacks is paramount to maintain

02:39.700 --> 02:41.900
the integrity of our digital lives.

02:41.900 --> 02:46.740
Remember, in the digital world, a firewall is your first line of defense.

02:46.740 --> 02:48.100
Stay protected, stay safe.

